    {
      "id": "3b6f21a",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. FRBM ACT (2003)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8mqovbz",
      "content": "Fiscal Responsibility and Budget Management (FRBM) Act aims to ensure fiscal discipline by limiting fiscal deficit and public debt."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "28jkd0n",
      "content": "It targets reduction of fiscal deficit to sustainable levels."
    },
    {
      "id": "k3t3k3n",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "8. DIRECT vs INDIRECT TAXES"
    },
