    {
      "id": "nnq820o",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "RRB HIGH-VALUE SUMMARY POINTS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "v7zdhqs",
      "content": "• FRBM limits fiscal deficit to 3% of GDP.<br></br>• Progressive tax reduces inequality.<br></br>• GST has CGST, SGST &amp; IGST.<br></br>• Primary Deficit excludes interest payments."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5vo2h63",
      "content": "• Fiscal Deficit = Total Expenditure – Total Receipts (excluding borrowings)<br></br>• Revenue Deficit shows dissaving of government<br></br>• FRBM Act enacted in 2003<br></br>• Expansionary policy used during recession<br></br>"
    }
  ],
  "enriched": true
}